codex
The long outer run exposed a second mechanism: the branch was receiving the recursive summary term itself, so the simplifier kept enumerating symbolic divisors. I’m changing the inner post-state to a fresh Boolean constrained equal to that summary. This preserves the machine-checked value connection while letting the outer branch split on one Boolean atom instead of unfolding an unbounded recursive evaluator.
